                                                "sense_id": "4b92ca95-d9fd-35fb-8969-f86db678c784",
                                                "text": "Mr Campbell Swinston.—Supposing there were no stronger reason than that against the continuance of grocers' licences, could not that evil be very easily put an end to by making a single false entry in the passbook the ground for forfeiting the grocer's certificate?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c51767bc-3f14-30e5-a626-9ef9ad9424e6",
                                        "entry_id": "36dae012-6b94-382c-b79a-929890bf92a0",
                                        "glosses": [
